    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "Well, I've been here almost seven years now. And I've seen this play call about four of the seven years that I've been here, what they're doing right now. They're not very original. They just do the same thing over and over. And my colleagues act like they get fooled all the time over and over or something. But here's the play call they're running this year. They are kicking the can down the road just a few weeks at a time until they get the can just a few days before Christmas. And I have been in close meetings with the GOP conference when John Boehner walks in. It's the day before we go on Christmas vacation. The CR has been punted. several times and he walked in he says we've got an omnibus and we're going to vote on it here and about an hour and if this thing passes if you all vote for it you can go home for christmas and be with your family but if it doesn't pass you can be here with Nancy Pelosi and uh... you know Chuck Schumer harry reed can't remember who it was at the",
